Z||000000||V8Fiero||05-27-2001||11:07 PM||||Ive got 4 codes showing right now.<P>Code 13<BR>Code 32<BR>Code 35 and<BR>Code 44<P>According to my Haynes manual, I do know that I should replace the O2 sensor. This would maybe clear up the code 13, and 44.<BR>Not sure about the other two. Any suggestions? I know the car is running rich now.The car sat for a couple of yrs not beening driven as well...<P>TIA<BR>Scott<P>------------------<BR>86 SE Gold<BR>84 SE V8 (FS or trade)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pffsig_1.jpg"> ||||reg||7
